WEBVTT

NOTE Full translated speech. Cue starts use source speech alignment.
End holds may extend within the observed pause before the next cue.

guia-desenvolvimento-fala-001
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.680 line:90% position:50% align:center size:90%
My speech got better, Mommy.

guia-desenvolvimento-fala-002
00:00:02.180 --> 00:00:06.820 line:90% position:50% align:center size:90%
That’s what my son Enzo told me, and that
moment moved me.

guia-desenvolvimento-fala-003
00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:12.400 line:90% position:50% align:center size:90%
At two years and nine months, Enzo began
getting stuck on words.

guia-desenvolvimento-fala-004
00:00:12.820 --> 00:00:15.840 line:90% position:50% align:center size:90%
Sometimes he squeezed his eye shut to get
the words out.

guia-desenvolvimento-fala-005
00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:21.860 line:90% position:50% align:center size:90%
In the early childhood Guia das Virtudes,
I looked for activities to help

guia-desenvolvimento-fala-006
00:00:21.860 --> 00:00:27.160 line:90% position:50% align:center size:90%
him build a sense of certainty, of being
loved, cared for and safe.

guia-desenvolvimento-fala-007
00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:32.460 line:90% position:50% align:center size:90%
For seven days, I told him the story of
the little bird who learned to fly.

guia-desenvolvimento-fala-008
00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:37.680 line:90% position:50% align:center size:90%
We drew, shared the trust-building hug,
and playfully repeated:

guia-desenvolvimento-fala-009
00:00:37.880 --> 00:00:42.740 line:90% position:50% align:center size:90%
“Everything will be fine. I can do it. I’m
loved and cared for.”

guia-desenvolvimento-fala-010
00:00:43.310 --> 00:00:48.730 line:90% position:50% align:center size:90%
I wanted him to feel safe, certain he was
being loved and

guia-desenvolvimento-fala-011
00:00:48.730 --> 00:00:53.610 line:90% position:50% align:center size:90%
cared for. To me, that came through warmth
and being there,

guia-desenvolvimento-fala-012
00:00:53.750 --> 00:00:54.790 line:90% position:50% align:center size:90%
every day.

guia-desenvolvimento-fala-013
00:00:55.630 --> 00:01:00.470 line:90% position:50% align:center size:90%
We also sang more and calmly repeated the
vowels, without rushing,

guia-desenvolvimento-fala-014
00:01:00.770 --> 00:01:01.630 line:90% position:50% align:center size:90%
or pressure.

guia-desenvolvimento-fala-015
00:01:01.910 --> 00:01:06.470 line:90% position:50% align:center size:90%
By week’s end, I noticed he no longer
squeezed his eye shut while speaking.

guia-desenvolvimento-fala-016
00:01:06.830 --> 00:01:12.370 line:90% position:50% align:center size:90%
He still struggled, but in the following
days, I began noticing better

guia-desenvolvimento-fala-017
00:01:12.370 --> 00:01:14.630 line:90% position:50% align:center size:90%
fluency, word by word.

guia-desenvolvimento-fala-018
00:01:15.350 --> 00:01:20.270 line:90% position:50% align:center size:90%
Even after those seven days of activities,
I noticed he kept

guia-desenvolvimento-fala-019
00:01:20.270 --> 00:01:22.530 line:90% position:50% align:center size:90%
recalling the affirmations day to day.

guia-desenvolvimento-fala-020
00:01:23.190 --> 00:01:27.210 line:90% position:50% align:center size:90%
Until he told me: “My speech got better,
Mommy.”

guia-desenvolvimento-fala-021
00:01:27.830 --> 00:01:33.150 line:90% position:50% align:center size:90%
What stayed with me most were those
moments of presence, warmth and

guia-desenvolvimento-fala-022
00:01:33.150 --> 00:01:34.590 line:90% position:50% align:center size:90%
connection with my son.

guia-desenvolvimento-fala-023
00:01:35.460 --> 00:01:39.100 line:90% position:50% align:center size:90%
That was our family’s experience with
Virtology.
